The two alumnae marriage record tables match: both break graduates down by decade of graduation and give married, unmarried and death counts and percentages. The 1919-20 title says "Tokyo Higher Women's School" and the 1924-25 title says "Tokyo Women's Higher Normal School". The columns and row labels (1879–88 through 1909–18, plus Total) are identical, so I treat them as the same institution's table.

The other two tables in 1924-25 have no counterpart in 1919-20, so they stay out of any family.

